<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">55块2 · 储蓄</view><view class="title">小荷包</view><view class="card"><view class="caption">已执行累计</view><view class="amount">¥ {{current}}</view><view class="progress"><view class="progress-fill" style="width: {{goalProgress}}%;"></view></view><view class="target-line"><text>¥{{goal}}</text><text>¥{{target}}</text></view><view class="list-row"><text>距离截止日</text><text class="value">{{daysLeft}} 天</text></view><view class="list-row"><text>精算终点完成度</text><text class="value">{{targetProgress}}%</text></view><view class="caption">只有执行发薪日划转后，金额才会进入这里。</view></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">已登记流水</view><view class="list-row"><text>工资卡 ①</text><text class="value">¥{{bankBalance}}</text></view><view class="list-row"><text>余额宝 ②</text><text class="value">¥{{poolBalance}}</text></view><view class="list-row"><text>小荷包 ③</text><text class="value">¥{{pocketBalance}}</text></view><view class="caption">计划累计与实际流水分开显示，避免把“准备存”误认为“已经存”。</view></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">登记专项支出</view><input class="special-input" placeholder="例如 Q4 水电" value="{{specialReason}}" bindinput="inputSpecialReason" /><input class="special-input" type="digit" placeholder="金额，例如 405.88" value="{{specialAmount}}" bindinput="inputSpecialAmount" /><button class="button secondary" bindtap="saveSpecial">从小荷包登记</button></view><view class="section-label">五期储蓄轨迹</view><block wx:for="{{periods}}" wx:key="index"><view class="card period-card"><view class="list-row"><view><view>{{item.completed ? '已完成' : '待完成'}}　·　第 {{item.index}} 期</view><view class="secondary-text">{{item.payDate}}　·　{{item.special}}</view></view><view class="value">¥{{item.actualAfter}}</view></view><view class="caption">本期实际转存 ¥{{item.save}}　·　计划累计 ¥{{item.pocket}}</view></view></block><view class="card"><view class="section-title">储蓄原则</view><view class="caption">先把今天过好，再让每一次结算都变成确定的积累。</view></view></view>
